## Simulation

### Waveform - Behavioral Simulation

```mermaid
timeline
    title SPI Simulation - A5 <-> 3C Exchange (205 ns)
    section Setup
        0 ns : rst = 0
        20 ns : rst = 1, master_data = A5, slave_tx_data = 3C
    section Start
        50 ns : start_tx = 1 pulse
        60 ns : start_tx = 0, cs = 0
    section Transfer
        60-190 ns : sclk toggles, MOSI sends A5, MISO sends 3C
        100 ns : slave_rx = 00 -> sampling
        190 ns : Transfer complete, 8 bits done
    section Done
        205 ns : master_rx_data = 3C
        205 ns : slave_rx_data = A5
        205 ns : tx_done = 1, rx_valid = 1, slave_rx_valid = 1

  sequenceDiagram
    participant M as SPI Master
    participant S as SPI Slave
    Note over M,S: CPOL=0, CPHA=0, msb_first=1
    M->>S: cs = 0 (Select Slave)
    M->>S: sclk toggles + MOSI = A5 (1010 0101)
    S->>M: MISO = 3C (0011 1100)
    Note over M: master_rx_data = 3C
    Note over S: slave_rx_data = A5
    M->>S: cs = 1 (Deselect)
    M->>M: tx_done = 1, rx_valid = 1
